    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tactical spellcraft in <strong><i>Pluto</i></strong>, a roguelike where you invoke elements to cast spells. Channel elements and chain combos to conquer your foes. Will your magic be powerful enough to reach your niece\u2019s birthday?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Cast</strong>\u00a0Acquire spells with elemental recipes and cast them through your fingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Spellbook</strong>\u00a0Discover new spells, upgrade old ones, and collect powerful rings and artifacts that reshape your strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Playstyles\u00a0</strong>Unlock characters with unique  spells and elemental affinities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong>\u00a0Adapt to tactical enemy formations, colossal bosses, and shifting  draws. No two runs play alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Horror</strong> Experience a  dark fantasy world with art by DitchWitch</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tactical spellcraft in <strong><i>Pluto</i></strong>, a roguelike where you invoke elements to cast spells. Channel elements and chain combos to conquer your foes. Will your magic be powerful enough to reach your niece\u2019s birthday?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Cast</strong>\u00a0Acquire spells with elemental recipes and cast them through your fingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Spellbook</strong>\u00a0Discover new spells, upgrade old ones, and collect powerful rings and artifacts that reshape your strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Playstyles\u00a0</strong>Unlock characters with unique  spells and elemental affinities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong>\u00a0Adapt to tactical enemy formations, colossal bosses, and shifting  draws. No two runs play alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Horror</strong> Experience a  dark fantasy world with art by DitchWitch</p></li></ul>",
